@startuml FrontendModuleStructure_Descriptive

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam noteBorderColor gray
skinparam noteBackgroundColor lightyellow

' Define layers as components
component "Presentation Layer" as PL #Moccasin
component "Application Layer" as AL #PaleGreen
component "Data Access Layer" as DAL #LightBlue
component "Utility Layer" as UL #Thistle

' Layout direction
top to bottom direction

' Dependencies (arrows are illustrative)
PL --> AL : uses logic and state
AL --> DAL : calls APIs, uses sockets
AL --> UL : uses shared utilities
PL --> UL : uses helpers
DAL --> UL : uses logging and helpers

' Notes for each layer
note right of PL
<b>Presentation Layer</b>
- UI Components: Buttons, forms, modals  
- Pages: Full screen layouts  
- Game UI: Specialized interaction views
end note

note right of AL
<b>Application Layer</b>
- Game Logic: Controls gameplay flow  
- User Management: Auth & profile logic  
- Multiplayer: Real-time sync with WebSockets  
- Score Management: Leaderboards and tracking
end note

note right of DAL
<b>Data Access Layer</b>
- API Services: REST interactions  
- WebSocket Services: Real-time data channels  
- State Management: App-wide data stores
end note

note right of UL
<b>Utility Layer</b>
- Common: Constants and helpers  
- Logging: Client-side logs and diagnostics
end note

@enduml
